# Everything this repository ignores, in one file.
#
# There is one .gitignore and it is this one. A second file in a subdirectory
# is a rule nobody can audit: the question "what does this repository ignore"
# has to have one answer, in one place.

# The Claude Code permissions of one person. The shared .claude/settings.json
# is not ignored, because a setting that belongs to the project is committed.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Scratch notes of one person.
/notes.txt
